rder-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">500 - 25,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">500 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 3, 2000<br/>Version 6.0 Beta</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20060123204053&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_Herb_87bf9c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a blood herb.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.20 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Often used in house decoration. It is a rare herb, due to its botanical property. Amongst the witches, it is widely known that a blood herb sucks all the life force from a tree leaving it dead. Putting 10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Coconut\">Coconuts</a> under a Blood Herb will make a nice decoration background. In earlier times it also used to spawn at the <a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Knight\">Black Knight</a> everyday.<br/>\nThis can only be obtained in <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a> swamps through the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-herb-quest\">Blood Herb Quest</a>. \nCan be handed over to <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyda\">Wyda</a> during the <a href=\"#/quest/bored-mini-world-change\">Bored Mini World Change</a> for a chance to get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Torn%20Teddy\">Torn Teddy</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>This herb used to look like this until Christmas Update 2005: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Blood Herb (Old)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_Herb_Old_c04ed7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sellto\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Chondur\">Chondur</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Meriana\">Meriana</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">500 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Atab\">Atab</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/blood-herb-quest\">Blood Herb Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/bored-mini-world-change\">Bored Mini World Change</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chondur\">Chondur</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coconut\">Coconut</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Daily%20Respawns\">Daily Respawns</a></li><li>Decorations</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Mushroom\">Green Mushroom</a></li><li>Herbs and Plants II (Book)</li><li>Mushrooms</li><li>Old Sprites</li><li>Plants and Herbs</li><li>Quests</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Torn%20Teddy\">Torn Teddy</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Torn%20Treasures\">Torn Treasures</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>